Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mptcp-bpf-ecf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libbpf0 | libbpf1
Description: MPTCP BPF ECF Scheduler
 BPF implementation of the ECF (Earliest Completion First) MPTCP
 scheduler. It sends on the lowest-RTT subflow while its congestion
 window has room, and when it has none, uses a slower subflow only if
 that does not delay the completion of the data left to send.
 .
 The compiled BPF object is installed into /usr/share/bpf/scheduler/
 and can be loaded with mptcpd or iproute2.
